WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.460
The day grid: every station and time slot at a glance.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:10.473
The banner compares open spots with how many shifts families still owe, across all days.

00:00:10.673 --> 00:00:19.470
Each cell is people over spots, colored empty, partly filled, full, or over. A marks the spots the coordinators assign.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.862
Tap a cell to open it. Everyone on that shift is listed.

00:00:24.062 --> 00:00:28.756
Parking has posts, like buses or directors. Pick one for each person.

00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:33.020
On the day, Check in or No-show. Remove takes them off.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:44.120
To add someone, search by name or email, and tap them. Admins can override restrictions, like putting a mature J H student on an adult spot.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.620
Next: setup.
